{"type":"agent_end","messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"schema\": \"aos-material-review/v1\", \"request_id\": \"qyh-current-host-oid-maintenance-review-20261013-r2\", \"task_id\": \"qyh-current-host-oid-maintenance-review-20261013\", \"owner\": \"codex-01a107a2-e9e4-7670-bc44-1144fa9b27e2\", \"kind\": \"quality\", \"baseline\": {\"head\": \"b5a2741e28e41e35f451ee4a83255e065fa7ca46\", \"authority_revision\": \"AOS-001999\", \"files\": {\".evidence/qyh-current-host-oid-maintenance-review-20261013/material-0.txt\": \"e948f552157b9f98d99102eda7a443c3cce493516db1d749ddb151e6c24278fb\", \".evidence/qyh-current-host-oid-maintenance-review-20261013/material-1.txt\": \"89d4fcb315a2982e441acf6d56f73fef2d8ee805721f4f4571d8035362addeaf\", \".evidence/qyh-current-host-oid-maintenance-review-20261013/material-2.txt\": \"aa395a1ac53b2b7a498c266151dbae62c9a04dc47064dd38f69eb7e447405e01\", \".evidence/qyh-current-host-oid-maintenance-review-20261013/material-3.txt\": \"8dc2f691cd30d771f1ebd4a83b17785efcef8c7e2971876e62c6fc6f0c9ed36c\", \".evidence/qyh-current-host-oid-maintenance-review-20261013/material-4.txt\": \"0fe7dae0fb906c3931e9015b5f747085deca16711a8c1c28540d9b6876337d4d\", \".evidence/qyh-current-host-oid-maintenance-review-20261013/material-5.txt\": \"28ca0343de8973f6b77ff2c856bb252ce0bbfeae627b65837d1e61c06ad0635d\", \".evidence/qyh-current-host-oid-maintenance-review-20261013/material-6.txt\": \"0133002954c3141a5b98abd6aa4acea38bbbbb8dd7deba8dee65d31dac8c8dd4\"}}, \"claims\": [\"The pre-execution maintenance plan relies on existing explicit human recovery authorization and exact parent current-volume scope; model review never grants execution authority.\", \"Fresh backup qualification is prepared and native current650 fingerprints/schema/roles/sequences were independently rechecked equal; the prior full restore and native clone CAS rehearsal passed. This claim is about preparation, not current write completion.\", \"The proposed execute script guards exact identity/lease/frozen consumed materials and original nativeCAS, then checks only3table changes/history/647 unaffected and noHost activation. No execute-intent or current mutation has happened yet.\"], \"materials\": {\".evidence/qyh-current-host-oid-maintenance-review-20261013/material-0.txt\": \"# 栖月汇当前Host OID原维护入口接续\\n\\nRules：用户已批准恢复/可修复漂移，231-4审计与恢复、原Task qyh-full-system-restoration-20261011单写scope；当前org-org/dev-project、原命名卷不替换、不重启系统、不启用Host/worker/Provider、不push。候选A为已通过独立全库restore的当前Host OID原CAS维护；候选B为Source reader/Plan锁耦合隔离兼容；选A。新增代码仅本目录current_host_oid_maintenance.py，必须原SQL维护函数，不改产品源码或历史行。\\n\\n依赖证据5364b6ba5及qyh-host-oid-durable-full-restore-20261013/verification.json，独立持久卷650表/roles/membership/sequences与原库相同，schema只有两条精确AND结合律重组；原CAS1→2及重放/冲突反例已验证，原650不变。执行前再次核父Task Lease、最新authority与原CID/volume/cluster/a0v161、全部executionbindings disabled、无执行事务及API无businessPOST/HostOFF；new pg_dump/globals双份校验与650表有界read-only指纹。\\n\\n当前identity exactRole aos_a0v_directory_20260912与host a0v-local-ecommerce-host-20260912，expectedRevision1，原storedOID203325与liveOID16385漂移。原extension_runtime_bind_host_identity(name,text,boolean,bigint,text,text,text)权限/Owner以及正式维护channel必须真实核验。维护actor记为已授权本线程恢复执行者，不能冒充人类Owner/审批人。新idem key/hash绑定当前identity和备份SHA，先exclusive intent，原受支持函数CAS事务提交；任何未知结果只读查receipt/history，不重发。\\n\\n完成必须currentroleOID回读一致、原revision1历史保留、仅三张Host表变化、其余647表全hash不变、序列与schema/roles unchanged；绑定仍disabled、HostOFF。后续独立正式三平面身份配置、最新m1API准备接线部署与原installation apply/verify门继续，不能称八台已恢复。\\n\", \".evidence/qyh-current-host-oid-maintenance-review-20261013/material-1.txt\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"Approved exact Host identity maintenance; native CAS only, no activation.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nimport importlib.util,sys,json,hashlib,os,shutil\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nfrom datetime import datetime,timezone\\nP=Path(__file__).resolve().parent\\nOUT=P/'current-host-oid-maintenance-20261013'\\nROOT=P.parents[1]\\ns=importlib.util.spec_from_file_location('restore',ROOT/'.evidence/qyh-host-oid-durable-full-restore-20261013/rehearse.py');r=importlib.util.module_from_spec(s);s.loader.exec_module(r)\\ns=importlib.util.spec_from_file_location('mc',ROOT/'scripts/memory/memoryctl.py');mc=importlib.util.module_from_spec(s);sys.modules[s.name]=mc;s.loader.exec_module(mc)\\nTASK='qyh-full-system-restoration-20261011'\\nREVIEW=ROOT/'.evidence/qyh-current-host-oid-maintenance-review-20261013'\\nQUERY=\\\"SELECT row_to_json(x) FROM (SELECT i.database_role::text,i.host_id,i.revision,i.database_role_oid::text AS stored_oid,r.oid::text AS current_oid FROM extension_runtime_host_identity i JOIN pg_roles r ON r.rolname=i.database_role::text WHERE i.database_role='aos_a0v_directory_20260912')x;\\\"\\ndef record(n,v):\\n with (OUT/n).open('x') as f:json.dump(v,f,indent=2)\\ndef read(q):return r.sql(r.SOURCE,'aos_meta_head','BEGIN READ ONLY;'+q+'COMMIT;')\\ndef guards():\\n assert mc.load_authority()['project_revision']=='AOS-001999'\\n l=next(x for x in mc.load_leases(mc.DEFAULT_PATHS)['leases'] if x['task_id']==TASK)\\n assert l['owner']==r.OWNER and datetime.fromisoformat(l['lease_expires_at'])>datetime.now(timezone.utc)\\n assert 'aos-platform/maintenance/qiyuehui-restored-data-volume' in l['scope']\\n source=json.loads(r.docker('inspect',r.SOURCE,text=True,capture_output=True).stdout)[0]\\n assert source['Id']==r.CID and source['State']['Running'] and source['Image']==r.IMAGE\\n assert len(source['Mounts'])==1 and source['Mounts'][0]['Name']=='aos-qyh-history159-prepared-data-20261011'\\n native=json.loads(read(\\\"SELECT json_build_object('cluster',(SELECT system_identifier::text FROM pg_control_system()),'schema',(SELECT version_num FROM alembic_version),'enabled',(SELECT count(*) FROM extension_runtime_binding WHERE enabled),'otherSessions',(SELECT count(*) FROM pg_stat_activity WHERE datname=current_database() AND pid<>pg_backend_pid()),'owner',(SELECT pg_get_userbyid(proowner) FROM pg_proc WHERE proname='extension_runtime_bind_host_identity'),'currentUser',current